  it("DON cards generated in detachDonFromSlot have no Date.now() in their IDs", () => {
    // replay the move twice with same ctx.turn — IDs must match
    expect(id1).toBe(id2);
  });
});
```

---

## Implementation Order

| Fix | File(s) | Effort | Phase |
|-----|---------|--------|-------|
| Fix 2 — Go Fish default mode | `gofish/crypto.ts:444` | 1 line | 1 |
| Fix 3 — OnePiece `Date.now()` | `onepiece/game.ts:470,842,879` | 3 lines | 1 |
