| Fix 6 — Reveal stall timeout (Go Fish, OnePiece) | respective modules | ~20 lines each | 3 |
| Fix 7 — Auth stubs | all game definitions | ~5 lines each | 4 |

Phases 1 and 2 can ship as a single PR. Phase 3 should be a second PR after Phase 1+2 tests pass. Phase 4 is gated on relay server deployment decisions.

---

## Out of Scope

The following issues from `SECURITY_REPORT.md` are **not** addressed by this plan:

